<title>HUNGARY: Hungary cenbank cuts 1-wk, 1-mo reverse repo rates.</title>
<headline>Hungary cenbank cuts 1-wk, 1-mo reverse repo rates.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday that it reduced its one-week reverse repo rate to 20.00 percent and its one-month reverse repo rate to 20.50 percent.</p>
<p>Each reverse repo rate facility was reduced by 0.25 percent.  </p>
<p>The NBH left all its other repo rates unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
